0..60 Comment "// A case on a parameter whose goal reads a later parameter."
61..63 Comment "//"
64..140 Comment "// The type of the later parameter reads the scrutinee. The goal reads both."
141..216 Comment "// The map over the arguments of a signature has this shape. Its goal reads"
217..288 Comment "// the signature and the arguments. The type of the arguments reads the"
289..302 Comment "// signature."
303..305 Comment "//"
306..381 Comment "// The checker generalises the case\'s motive over each later binder that an"
382..458 Comment "// arm or the motive reads and whose type reads the scrutinee. Each arm then"
459..535 Comment "// meets the later binder at its own constructor. Here no arm reads `v`, and"
536..565 Comment "// the motive alone reads it."
566..568 Comment "//"
569..584 Comment "// - see: #5324"
585..655 Comment "// - see: #3483 — the generalisation over a binder that an arm reads"
